# Project Mu (無) — patch application order
# One patch filename per line, relative to patches/. Applied top to bottom.
# Lines starting with '#' and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Patches are authored against a real unpacked src/ tree (Phase 2), so they
# stay commented out until the .patch file exists and has been verified.

# 0001-default-search-duckduckgo.patch
# 0002-disable-history-by-default.patch
# 0003-strip-google-telemetry.patch
